|---|---|---|
| `IF @CustId = '1072'` | 1072 | NULL amt outside InstallmentInd 1–4; no AgencyName |
| `ELSE IF @CustId = '2118'` | 2118 | Standard TaxId; AgencyId fallback PayeeCode; AgencyName |
| `ELSE IF @CustId = '2161'` | 2161 | MI county prefix on TaxId; VendorAgencyId always |
| `ELSE IF @CustId = '2164'` | 2164 | MI county prefix + stripped TaxId; AgencyId fallback |
| `ELSE IF @CustId = '2215'` | 2215 | Standard TaxId; VendorAgencyId always; AgencyName |
| `ELSE` | 1085, 1090, 1096, 2132 | Original 6a logic — unchanged |

